WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:03.008
A ratio compares two amounts.

00:03.458 --> 00:10.493
Here are three blue squares and two orange squares. The ratio of blue to orange is three to two.

00:10.943 --> 00:15.889
The order matters. The ratio of orange to blue is two to three.

00:16.339 --> 00:21.898
We can make an equal ratio by multiplying both numbers by the same amount.

00:21.898 --> 00:24.977
Double three and two to get six and four.

00:25.427 --> 00:33.159
Six to four is the same ratio as three to two. We multiply or divide both parts by the same number.
